{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>To you it shall be for food, and to every beast of the earth.</b> He assigned animals and beasts to them for food alike, and did not permit man and his wife to kill a creature and eat flesh — but every green herb they would all eat together. When the sons of Noah came, He permitted them flesh, as it is said: ״כָּל רֶמֶשׂ אֲשֶׁר הוּא חַי״ and so forth — like the green herb that I permitted to the first man, I have given you everything."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:10.609788200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}